        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-60" parent="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-24" style="text;html=1;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;sketch=0;labelBackgroundColor=#fbf4f4;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Principles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;0. Data Residency:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;GermanyWestCentral Region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. High availabiltiy - solution is deployed in 2 Availability Zones (AZs)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. &lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;All Internet inbound/outbound traffic will traverse through the firewall. All express route traffic to connect on-premise network will traverse trough the firewall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. AKS connects all Azure resources (acr, kv, storage....) via private endpoints, which will go over Azure backbone instead of internet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4. Database will not be publicly exposed, database encryption via file system and TDE, &lt;font color=&quot;#3e1919&quot;&gt;data-in-transit encyrption via TLS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5. Admin and devops team access azure resources (e.g. db, kv, aks) via bastion/devops machine to limitate internet access. No public IPs are exposed except the bastion and firewall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;6. Network security group will be utilized to restrict connection between subnets (establish connections only when needed)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7. Vulnerability Management: components are managed services, VM patching is performed via&amp;nbsp; Azure update management centre. Kubernetes upgrade are triggered manually and executed by Azure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;8. User will authenticate via OpenAuth (SSO via AD)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;9. Inbound cleartext traffic from Internet is disabled, outbound cleartext traffic is only allowed where required by Microsoft&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="930" x="680" y="-120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-61" parent="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-24" style="aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;image;fontSize=12;image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" value="" vertex="1">
