        <mxCell id="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-634" parent="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-520" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#3e1919;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 26); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;GHAs:&lt;br&gt;- GHA authenticate to Azure APIs to deploy infrastructure via an Azure SP. &lt;br&gt;In Production, for each deployment a new secret is created and deleted after the deployment completes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
