        <mxCell id="EkIpqa0lRWCONsxsSRhO-2" parent="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-688" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Azure Cloud Infrastructure Components:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Virtual Network (VNet):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Secures communication between components.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hub-and-spoke architecture for enhanced security and separation of different environments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Network Security Groups (NSGs):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Provide granular control over network traffic to and from Azure resources on subnet level.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;ExpressRoute:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Enables private connections between on-premises networks and Azure data centers, bypassing the public internet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Firewall:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Centralized network security solution for filtering and monitoring traffic between Azure services. All inbound and outbound traffic goes through FW.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Application Gateway:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Offers Layer 7 load balancing and Web Application Firewall (WAF) capabilities to protect web applications from common attacks.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;API Gateway:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Manages access control, load balancing, and routing of requests to LLM services.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Bastion:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Provides secure and seamless RDP and SSH access to virtual machines directly from the Azure portal without exposing them to the public internet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Private Links/Private Endpoints:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Enable private access to Azure services without exposing traffic to the public internet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure App Service:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hosts simple applications (e.g., basic chatbots).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Works well with Azure OpenAI Studio solutions combined with Azure AI Search, leveraging the RAG (Retrieval-Augmented-Generation) pattern.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hosts containerized applications (preferably microservice architectures).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Supports hosting open-source LLMs like LLaMA in containers (e.g., with Docker).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Provides scalability for high workloads and flexibility.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Database:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hosts relational and non-relational databases for data storage and processing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure OpenAI Studio:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Provides access to pre-trained models (e.g., GPT-4).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Allows fine-tuning of existing models with enterprise-specific data.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Integrates well with Azure AI Search and RAG solutions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure AI Search:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Offers intelligent search capabilities, enhancing information retrieval with AI.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Key Vault:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Manages sensitive data such as API keys, passwords, and certificates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Container Registry (ACR):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Stores and manages container images for deployment in Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Storage Account:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Stores training data and model artifacts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Monitor (incl. Log Analytics, Prometheus, Grafana, etc.):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Provides monitoring and logging for model performance and resource usage.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Azure Active Directory (AAD):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Manages user identities and access rights.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1480" width="560" x="370" y="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EkIpqa0lRWCONsxsSRhO-3" parent="QJVMCspfU_33AnuVPJ_e-688" style="aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;image;fontSize=12;image=img/lib/azure2/networking/Virtual_Networks.svg;" value="" vertex="1">
